    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/6582245d96f30207e085809e9456f16c.poster.avif?t=1752469527\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/6582245d96f30207e085809e9456f16c.webm?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/6582245d96f30207e085809e9456f16c.mp4?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Combat Using a Variety of Weapons</strong>: In <i>One and Done</i>, you'll explore dungeons and battle monsters using four unique weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/35372d7f933837a283fb181ec5df5210.poster.avif?t=1752469527\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/35372d7f933837a283fb181ec5df5210.webm?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/35372d7f933837a283fb181ec5df5210.mp4?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switching Weapons to Fit the Situation</strong>: Weapons frequently change within the dungeon, so you'll need to strategically utilize each weapon's distinct characteristics and abilities for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/e6a8cd09d41ced9aa37fab06a971cfbb.poster.avif?t=1752469527\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/e6a8cd09d41ced9aa37fab06a971cfbb.webm?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/e6a8cd09d41ced9aa37fab06a971cfbb.mp4?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Monsters and Battles</strong>: Encounter a wide range of monsters and increasingly powerful foes. Choosing the right weapon to match the enemy's traits can determine the outcome of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/b646a385b059db9cb09e65ac8489fac3.poster.avif?t=1752469527\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/b646a385b059db9cb09e65ac8489fac3.webm?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/b646a385b059db9cb09e65ac8489fac3.mp4?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploring Maze-like Dungeons</strong>: Navigate through dungeon mazes, uncover hidden paths, defeat enemies, and push forward in your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/b7beb7f5654f14629fbf7ef08819f4d0.poster.avif?t=1752469527\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/b7beb7f5654f14629fbf7ef08819f4d0.webm?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/b7beb7f5654f14629fbf7ef08819f4d0.mp4?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Strategic Options</strong>: Adapt to ever-changing battle scenarios by adjusting your weapons and strategies based on your judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/199057a114fce6407031d968f0270b9d.poster.avif?t=1752469527\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/199057a114fce6407031d968f0270b9d.webm?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/199057a114fce6407031d968f0270b9d.mp4?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer dungeons with your unique strategies and experience the thrill of defeating formidable monsters!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/6582245d96f30207e085809e9456f16c.poster.avif?t=1752469527\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/6582245d96f30207e085809e9456f16c.webm?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/6582245d96f30207e085809e9456f16c.mp4?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Combat Using a Variety of Weapons</strong>: In <i>One and Done</i>, you'll explore dungeons and battle monsters using four unique weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/35372d7f933837a283fb181ec5df5210.poster.avif?t=1752469527\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/35372d7f933837a283fb181ec5df5210.webm?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/35372d7f933837a283fb181ec5df5210.mp4?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switching Weapons to Fit the Situation</strong>: Weapons frequently change within the dungeon, so you'll need to strategically utilize each weapon's distinct characteristics and abilities for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/e6a8cd09d41ced9aa37fab06a971cfbb.poster.avif?t=1752469527\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/e6a8cd09d41ced9aa37fab06a971cfbb.webm?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/e6a8cd09d41ced9aa37fab06a971cfbb.mp4?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Monsters and Battles</strong>: Encounter a wide range of monsters and increasingly powerful foes. Choosing the right weapon to match the enemy's traits can determine the outcome of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/b646a385b059db9cb09e65ac8489fac3.poster.avif?t=1752469527\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/b646a385b059db9cb09e65ac8489fac3.webm?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/b646a385b059db9cb09e65ac8489fac3.mp4?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploring Maze-like Dungeons</strong>: Navigate through dungeon mazes, uncover hidden paths, defeat enemies, and push forward in your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/b7beb7f5654f14629fbf7ef08819f4d0.poster.avif?t=1752469527\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/b7beb7f5654f14629fbf7ef08819f4d0.webm?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/b7beb7f5654f14629fbf7ef08819f4d0.mp4?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Strategic Options</strong>: Adapt to ever-changing battle scenarios by adjusting your weapons and strategies based on your judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/199057a114fce6407031d968f0270b9d.poster.avif?t=1752469527\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/199057a114fce6407031d968f0270b9d.webm?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/199057a114fce6407031d968f0270b9d.mp4?t=1752469527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer dungeons with your unique strategies and experience the thrill of defeating formidable monsters!</p>",
